# energy is the lowest quench at or below SLOPPYCONV. lowest_energy on each start is the lowest finite evaluation.
# The 06 Aug 2014 file names code wales-27058. That binary is not published. GMIN df8da599 has SYMMETRISECSM, so this row runs on df8da599. The deck is the archive data file: TEMPERATURE 3.0, NEWRESTART 30, AVOID 1.25 18, STEP 0.43 0.52, SLOPPYCONV 0.002, PERMDIST 0.005, MAXIT 1000 1000, STEPS 90000000 1.0, SAVE 1, SORT, and SYMMETRISECSM 1 CI 1.0D-6 30 1 50. RANSEED is unset. RADIUS is omitted and the coordinates are not translated before CENTRE. The problem file states no max_force_calls, so the campaign cap is the lj38 template budget 2000000. EDIFF is 0.001, the problem energy_above_minimum. The archive data file sets EDIFF 0.003. TARGET is the harness energy of codes/gmin/reference/lj38.points. The data file starts with MPI because the binary is the MPI build, and mpirun launches one replica.
